---
const bodyParagraph = 'text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed text-zinc-400';
---

<section
  id="problem"
  aria-labelledby="problem-heading"
  class="py-20 md:py-28 border-t border-zinc-800"
>
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6">
    <h2 id="problem-heading" class="text-2xl md:text-3xl mb-8">The Problem</h2>
    <p class={bodyParagraph}>
      AI agents are being deployed into environments containing:
    </p>
    <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 my-6 text-zinc-400">
      <li>customer data</li>
      <li>payment systems</li>
      <li>regulated data</li>
      <li>production infrastructure</li>
    </ul>
    <p class={bodyParagraph}>
      Many governance tools explain what happened after the fact.
    </p>
    <p class={`${bodyParagraph} mt-6`}>
      Regulated organizations need deterministic control before consequential
      actions occur.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
